{
 "description": "Large transfer counts and USD totals per chain, one row per transaction over 500,000 USD, with exchangeTouching = transfers from or to a known exchange hot wallet or deposit address. What is counted: ethereum, bnb, polygon, avalanche native-coin transfers in transfers and totalUsd, and their stablecoin transfers of 500,000 USD or more (USDT, USDC, USD1, USDS, U, USDC.e) in stablecoins, with the blocks read against the block span as coverage; tron TRX and TRC-20 stablecoins; xrp native XRP; sui native SUI; bitcoin since 2026-09-25, the value sent to addresses other than the sender. exchangeTouching is null on bitcoin, tron and sui (too few labelled exchange addresses). Large solana transfers are not captured: the solana row answers null. window in hours default 24 max 168. Price: 2 cents per call.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "chain": {
    "enum": [
     "bitcoin",
     "ethereum",
     "bnb",
     "solana",
